Nicholas Wheeler
Reed College Physics
2 May 2008\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4185614680756807`*^9, 3.418561485763381*^9}, {
  3.4187434051182203`*^9, 3.418743407122156*^9}}],

