   3.4185835343242807`*^9}],

Cell["\<\
The 2-dimensional free-particle Schr\[ODoubleDot]dinger equation then reads\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.418575958701046*^9, 3.418576009790058*^9}}],

