 "which, though everywhere non-negative, is ",
 StyleBox["not normalized",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 ", so cannot be interpreted as \"probability density.\" Introducing the \
associated current (which is not \"probability current\")"
}], "Text",
